# Trivy vulnerability exception list — DAEP / RE-OS (WP-003-04)
# Authority: CONTAINER_SECURITY.md
#
# Empty by default. Every entry below MUST include:
#   1. The CVE ID as a comment header
#   2. A one-line justification
#   3. A review-by date (ISO 8601)
# Entries without both a justification and a review-by date will be
# rejected in review — do not add a CVE here "to unblock a build."
#
# Format:
# CVE-YYYY-NNNNN
# # Justification: <why this finding is a false positive / accepted risk>
# # Review by: YYYY-MM-DD
